<title>SWEDEN: Swedish air cargo rises 22 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Swedish air cargo rises 22 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's domestic and international airports handled 13,909 tonnes of freight in March, a 22 percent rise on a year ago, the Swedish civil aviation said on Monday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>			    March 1997    Pct change vs March 1996</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)    13,909		    +22 pct</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	2,776		    +9 pct</p>
<p> Passengers	     1,551,042		 +4 pct</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
